## Problem classes

### `Vpn overlay classified as Other`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| AUTO flaps PROXY↔VPN when VPN is up | `activeNetwork` is `TRANSPORT_VPN` | Strip our VPN; classify underlying Wi-Fi/cell/other |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Split-brain node`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Same node ID, two paths, peers confused | libzt and JNI both opened `identity.secret` | Mutex; wait UDP/lock files gone; never two processes on same identity |

